# "Enchant creature card in a graveyard": with an Ornithopter on the battlefield and only a Lightning Bolt in a graveyard
# (a creature, but not a card in a graveyard; a card in a graveyard, but not a creature) Animate Dead has no legal target
# and cannot be cast (CR 303.4a, 601.2c). Once Cut Down has put the Ornithopter in the graveyard on turn 3, the same cast is
# offered and returns it - the positive control for the refusal.

